{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02879","headline":"奉和别越王 · 刘禕之","name":"奉和别越王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周屏辞金殿，梁骖整玉珂。\n管声依折柳，琴韵动流波。\n鹤盖分阴促，龙轩别念多。\n延襟小山路，还起大风歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禕之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}